# Real environment files carry secrets and must never be committed. `.env` WAS
# tracked until 2026-08-20 and its DB_PASSWORD, PAYER_API_KEY and
# SESSION_SECRET are still recoverable from git history — history was
# deliberately not rewritten, so ROTATION is the control here, not deletion.
# See adr/0007. `.env.example` is the template and stays tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
